    "summary": "Mask made of wood, hair (human?), hide, cloth, metal, bone (fish?), string, sinew, sea-lion whisker. Blue base, red lips and nostrils, broad black eyebrows, no ears.  Remains of elabourate mechanism for opening and closing rubber upper and lower eyelids. Upper lip also moveable, made of skin, operated with strings. Skin of upper lip brownish - probably smoked. The thick cords for suspension may be of elk skin.",
